ersation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And don't put yourself in danger over any of this."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I don't want someone else getting hurt."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Wow."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I've been talking for ages."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Sorry."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"You probably didn't expect to get my entire life story in one conversation."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4206/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Although, to be fair, you only got the very confusing version."]]],[[281,545]]],["DIV",{"class":"opening-actions opening-v4-composer"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-action-heading"},"Choose a reply"],["DIV",{"class":"scene01-options"},["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"I don't mind."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"You seem like you needed someone to talk to."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"You should probably get some rest."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},"I've definitely had stranger conversations."],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice ","aria-pressed":"false"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"14","height":"14","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-star","aria-label":"Premium"},["path",{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"}]],"For what it's worth, Daniel's lucky to have someone who cares about him this much."]],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-primary","disabled":""},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-send","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"}],["path",{"d":"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"}]]," Send"]]]],[[284,45]]]]],[[292,59]],[[292,60]]]],"viewport":{"width":412,"height":839},"timestamp":2556303.765,"wallTime":1792587210272,"collectionTime":8,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
